# UXC: H.264 with fps and bitrate changes, keyframe requests (coalesced), MJPEG switch, a failed push.
chip ux
board beta
file /etc/kvm/hdmi_mode 0
file /kvmapp/kvm/state 0\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/width 1920\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/height 1080\n
vidbg auto
src 1920 1080
call init
at 1100
call h264 1920 1080 30 2000 every 33 until 1500
call idr
call h264 1920 1080 30 2000
call idr
call h264 1920 1080 30 2000 every 33 until 1800
call h264 1920 1080 30 2000 every 100 until 2000
call idr
at 2000
call h264 1920 1080 60 2000 every 17 until 2500
at 2500
call h264 1920 1080 60 3000 every 17 until 3000
at 3000
call mjpeg 1920 1080 80 every 33 until 3500
at 3500
call h264 1920 1080 60 3000 every 17 until 4000
at 4000
venc fail push
at 4010
venc fail none
at 4000
call h264 1920 1080 60 3000 every 17 until 4500
at 4500
call h264 1280 720 30 20000 every 33 until 5000
at 5000
call h264 1920 1080 0 100 every 33 until 5200
at 6000
end
